## Python AI Microservice

File: [main.py](file:///e:/University/STKN/WebIeltsFree/python_ai_service/app/main.py) (654 dòng)

### Endpoints

| Endpoint | Method | Chức năng |
|---|---|---|
| `/health` | GET | Health check |
| `/v1/writing/evaluate` | POST | Chấm Writing (Task 1/2) → band scores + feedback |
| `/v1/speaking/evaluate` | POST | Chấm Speaking → band scores + feedback |
| `/ws/speaking` | WebSocket | **Real-time Speaking exam simulation** |

### Speaking WebSocket Flow
1. **`start`** → Examiner mở đầu ("Could you tell me your full name?")
2. **`user_answer`** → Candidate trả lời → Topic guard check → Gemini stream response
3. Part tự động chuyển: Part 1 (3 turns) → Part 2 (cue card) → Part 3 (analytical questions)
4. **Topic Guard**: keyword matching + Gemini AI relevance check, 3 warnings = terminated
5. **Safety Filter**: từ khóa nguy hiểm → terminate ngay
6. **Avatar**: D-ID API tạo video talking-head cho examiner
7. **Fallback**: khi Gemini unavailable, dùng hardcoded responses

